WEBVTT

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.650
<i>Ever since I was a child, 
I have sought power.</i>

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:31.170
<i>I thought that as long as I had power, 
nothing could ever be taken from me.</i>

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.190
<i>That I could be happy.</i>

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.500
<i>I got the power I wanted.</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.160
<i>I summoned powerful ayakashi 
monsters to be my servants,</i>

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.640
<i>and became the strongest 
in every sense of the word.</i>

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.710
<i>But on that awful night...</i>

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:29.710
<i>So this is the end of "history's 
strongest exorcist"...</i>

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>The fact that my students 
were taken as hostages...</i>

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:37.490
<i>The fact that I had to oppose 
the Imperial Court...</i>

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.690
<i>It was all because I sought too much power.</i>

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:46.620
<i>So I lost everything...</i>

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:51.420
<i>It's fine. It's not your fault.</i>

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:57.160
<i>The Court are cowards... 
sending my favorite student after me...</i>

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.290
<i>What I lacked was cunning.</i>

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.830
<i>But next time, I'll do better.</i>

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.670
<i>I'll start over. One more time.</i>

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.980
<i>And this time, I won't fail.</i>

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.610
<i>In my next life...</i>

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:24.950
Spirits of fire, water, earth, 
wind, light, and shadow.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.120
In the name of Blaze Lamprouge, 
I beg of you...

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.540
Show me the power that this child possesses.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.830
<i>What?</i>

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:43.840
<i>Is that even possible?</i>

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.680
<i>Look at this, Brother Ruft!</i>

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.520
<i>None of the element stones are shining!</i>

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.490
<i>That means what I think 
it does, right father?</i>

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.060
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.150
<i>The ritual is over.</i>

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:58.320
<i>Seika lacks any magical power at all.</i>

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.160
<i>You're an embarrassment!</i>

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:06.680
<i>In this world, humans and demons 
co-exist, and magic is real.</i>

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:12.280
<i>This is the home of the Lamprouge Clan, 
an important clan of Mages.</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.730
<i>I was reborn as 
Seika Lamprouge, its third son...</i>

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.090
<i>Though my mother was a mistress, I've heard.</i>

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.190
<i>And without any magic, either.</i>

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.010
<i>But it's not an issue.</i>

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.180
<i>This body may have no magical power,</i>

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.190
<i>but it has incredible spiritual power.</i>

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:43.230
Paper's valuable, so I'll try with this.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.450
On pancharika vidi sowaka.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.380
Shikigami

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.960
Done. My leaf shikigami are complete.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.140
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.690
Say something! Loser!

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.100
Brother Gly, stop it.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.570
"Please stop, sir", you mean.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.110
That's not how you talk to your elders.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.700
Loser!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.200
What the heck is going on?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.630
Get away from him!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.540
I guess that's being too hard on the kid.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.140
Where did those crows come from?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.630
Gly, are you hurt?

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.460
It hurts. It hurts!

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.120
Are you okay, Seika?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.130
Yeah.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.740
I see.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.010
<i>I can see why he's suspicious.</i>

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.980
<i>It's weird that I was the 
only one they didn't attack.</i>

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.350
<i>Well, I've sent my shikigami off.</i>

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.890
<i>That'll make it easier to gather 
information about this world.</i>

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.070
<i>I'm 7 years old now.</i>

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:08.270
<i>But perhaps since I'm the child of a 
mistress, there was no celebration.</i>

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.790
<i>Most people just left me alone.</i>

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:15.160
<i>I learned a lot after that.</i>

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.080
<i>This country is huge.</i>

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.430
<i>It's similar in some ways to the 
land of Europe in my old world,</i>

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:25.150
<i>but the civilization here is more 
advanced, peaceful, and wealthy.</i>

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.470
Huh?

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.230
Yes?

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.640
Yifa?

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.860
Seika, um... here.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.910
It was in the bushes.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.870
Thanks, Yifa.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.330
<i>Gly again, I assume.</i>

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.730
I'm amazed you found it, though.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.900
Well, um...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.470
It was just luck.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.900
Hey, slave!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.140
Master Gly!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:06.840
Why aren't you working?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.300
I'm sorry, sir!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:14.350
Seika, you out playing in the grass again?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.830
Life's easy when you have no magic.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.030
You don't have to study.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.570
Me, though? I'm going to a magic academy!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.110
So I'm busy! Unlike you!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:31.320
And I'm on my way to 
Imperial Lodonea Magic Academy, too,

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.820
a famous school that's produced 
a lot of court mages!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.290
Lodonea Magic Academy...

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.500
Just so you know there's no 
way you're getting there!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.260
The best you can hope for is the army-

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.800
What are you doing?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:51.930
Gly. I told you I would 
help you study magic today.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.910
Come with me.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:53.930
Y-Yes, sir.

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.270
Father?

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.650
May I come, too?

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:11.140
Green gathers in a spiral, 
spirits fill the air...

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.240
Come together and become my blade! 
Wind Edge!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.170
Okay. Your turn Gly.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.410
Go for it!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.290
Right!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.040
Red burns bright!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.570
Spirits of flame and sulfur!

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.450
Let out a roar and gather 
your anger into a sphere!

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.220
Fireball!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.260
Okay.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:43.230
Since Dad's watching, 
why don't you give it a try?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.870
Come on, go ahead.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.490
Stop it, Gly.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.180
Okay. I'll try it.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:57.050
<i>I swore a vow that I wouldn't 
seek power or to become strong.</i>

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:01.220
<i>So to be honest, I don't want 
to reveal my spells here.</i>

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.580
<i>But...</i>

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.170
Look at him, holding it like a grown-up.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.700
<i>The truth is that the strong 
always exploit the weak.</i>

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.600
<i>I call forth earth and fire.</i>

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.180
<i>Phosphorous fragments summoned as Earth ki,</i>

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.550
<i>and ignited by fire ki.</i>

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.240
On aguni buumi sowaka.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.520
Fireball.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.250
<i>Phase of fire and earth.</i>

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.230
<i>Oni Flame!</i>

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.590
A blue fireball?

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:32.650
With no incantation?

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.280
And how is it so strong?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.130
Maybe my magic was so strong some 
of it remained in the wand?

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.910
<i>No, that's not how it works.</i>

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:48.420
There are examples of people who were able 
to use magic without being born with it.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:53.340
It's also said that the nature of their 
magic can cause the flame to change color.

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:58.140
Father, I wish to learn magic, too.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:01.470
No.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:02.970
Why?

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:07.080
There are no stories of mages born 
without magic becoming great successes.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.460
There's no point in you learning.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:17.280
But I'm thinking of giving you a 
tutor this year, like your brothers.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.330
Concentrate on your studies.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.790
I understand, Father.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.810
Don't get cocky! 
Remember, you have no magic!

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.290
<i>Well, that didn't work.</i>

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:33.800
<i>I guess I'll start by 
learning about this world.</i>

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:04.160
<i>The days and months passed, 
and soon I was 11.</i>

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.410
<i>It's done.</i>

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:12.420
<i>In my last life, I defeated and 
sealed many powerful ayakashi,</i>

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.570
<i>then forced them to serve me in battle.</i>

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.650
<i>"Sealing" means sending 
something to another plane.</i>

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.620
<i>And "another plane" isn't that 
different than another world.</i>

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.930
<i>So as long as I can prepare the door...</i>

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.590
<i>I don't know what will happen, to be honest.</i>

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:31.100
<i>So my first ayakashi will 
be my least threatening.</i>

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:37.240
On chatorudashu dashu torininavu 
navu ekamu eruviati sakaru sowaka.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.740
I summon you, Kudagitsune!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:01.170
Did it work? 
But something seems different...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.110
Haruyoshi!

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:05.140
Haruyoshi! Haruyoshi!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:10.990
I'm so happy I get to see you again!

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:09.690
Get off me, damn it!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.770
<i>In my last life, she was 
a beautiful woman, but...</i>

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.170
You're Yuki, right?

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:19.700
Yes, Haruyoshi. It's me, Yuki!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.770
You look younger.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.760
You're right!

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.370
Maybe it's due to the state of 
your spiritual power right now...

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:30.360
Or maybe it's the influence of this world?

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.820
Either seems possible.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:35.690
Either way, I'm glad I 
was able to summon you.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.800
I'm glad good to see you again, Yuki.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.930
Me, too!

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:42.380
Now that I'm here, 
I'll do whatever you want!

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:45.220
What is your request of me?

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.330
Nothing, really.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.400
I was just trying this out.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:53.950
And I can't let anybody see you...

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:02.070
I'm sick of that other plane. 
So I'll hide here.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.260
Sure, I guess.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:07.990
Also, I'm Seika now. Not Haruyoshi.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.230
I'm surprised you knew it was me, actually.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.020
Got it, Seika!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.920
You're very small, now that I think about it.

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.410
You just noticed?

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.870
Hey, slave.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.860
Do you know what you've just done?

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:29.540
You got water all over my clothes!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.020
I'm sorry!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:37.090
Looks like you think you can get away 
with this stuff 'cause Dad's nice to you.

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:40.340
You're right, sir. I'm sorry.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.360
But well...

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.740
I don't want to be too hard on you.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.790
I-I know! Come to my room tonight!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:57.780
I-I'll educate you on what 
it means to be a slave.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:01.960
<i>Gly's that age now, huh?</i>

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.260
If you're going to give her 
a lecture, make it fast.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.820
I have business with Yifa.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.310
Seika...

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.600
What makes you think you 
can talk to me like that?

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.700
You'd better watch your back, loser!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.210
Thanks, Seika.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.950
Don't worry about it. 
You don't have to go to his room, okay?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.450
Okay, right.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.510
Could you come with me?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:42.530
An ayakashi? No, a monster...

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.220
I think it's a baby carbuncle.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:49.010
Its mom was probably attacked by the crows.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:52.270
Can we save it?

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:57.180
Hmm, I can't say for sure, but I'll try.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:01.230
But I can't concentrate while somebody's 
looking at me. Will you turn the other way?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:02.860
O-Okay.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:12.670
On herii sutanaantaran 
torahanyuunan dasha sowaka.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.590
It's done.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.320
Wow!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.490
You can use healing magic, huh?

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.190
I guess so, yeah.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:34.250
Seika, you are really amazing. 
They say you don't have any magic,

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:38.180
but you can use spells 
just like Ruft and Gly.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.730
You're special, too, aren't you?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.150
You see things others don't, don't you?

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.840
I-I don't know what you're talking about!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:56.910
I've seen your eyes following the 
spirits of animals several times.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.330
You can see them, too?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.540
The spirits, yes.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:04.060
But you see something more.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.710
What do you see?

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.260
You really are amazing, Seika.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.390
You found out my secret.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:18.860
Mom told me not to tell anybody, 
before she died, but...

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.140
These are the elementals.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:26.510
I found your lost jacket thanks to them.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.570
They gather around magic.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:34.440
But your things are a little special.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:35.490
Special?

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:39.660
It's almost funny how much they 
gather around your things.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:45.540
But they don't gather around you. 
It's like they're avoiding you.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.080
<i>Why, I wonder?</i>

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.230
<i>I guess it doesn't matter.</i>

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.340
<i>What matters is...</i>

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.610
Hey, can you get the elementals 
to do what you say?

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:56.520
Um, just once.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.340
Stop!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:06.060
I yelled and they all ran away...

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.990
I'm sorry about that.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.870
<i>They listen to her.</i>

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:13.910
<i>That's big.</i>

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:19.470
In my last life, bakegitsune foxes 
could command hitodama spirits.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:21.650
<i>I thought that a caster 
could do the same thing,</i>

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.070
<i>and I spent a lot of time on research,</i>

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:24.820
<i>but I couldn't do it.</i>

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:29.370
<i>I was hoping to find 
someone with that talent...</i>

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:32.350
<i>I didn't think I'd find 
her so quickly, though.</i>

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:33.490
Hey, Yifa.

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.220
What?

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.180
Any interest in being able to use magic?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:44.760
I'd love to be able to, but I don't have 
enough magical power in me to cast spells.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.110
No, you don't need magical power.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.270
<i>Summon hitodama.</i>

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.310
What is this?

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.720
Something like an elemental, maybe?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.330
Don't worry, it's harmless.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.780
Okay...

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.330
Let's make it disappear, then.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.210
Try it like you tried 
with the wind elementals.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:09.480
Okay. I'll try.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.220
Please disappear.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.300
Please disappear, okay?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:24.050
Um... really! Please!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.250
Just disappear!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.350
It disappeared.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:30.530
Nice.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.820
<i>She's got the knack.</i>

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:36.980
<i>She's not strong enough yet, 
but she's worth making an ally.</i>

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:38.990
<i>I'm lucky.</i>

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:42.160
From now on, let's train you once in a while.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:44.350
Okay!

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.520
<i>I turned 12 years old today.</i>

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:21.070
<i>Unlike my brothers I don't get a 
feast for my birthday, or presents.</i>

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:24.870
<i>My father isn't even here.</i>

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:30.620
<i>That's how it's been every year.</i>

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.540
<i>Not that I care.</i>

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:35.860
Hey, Seika.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.940
We'll help train you.

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:41.380
What's this about?

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:44.380
Your mother is a mistress. 
You can't be an heir.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.360
And you don't have enough 
magical power to study magic.

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.080
You'll have to go to the army.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.860
So we'll help train you.

00:18:56.390 --> 00:18:58.240
Be grateful.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.030
Gly, you don't have to say it like that.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.350
The head sergeant is teaching 
us to fight with swords.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:06.040
I think we can teach you.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:09.210
Only if you want, of course...

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:10.600
Master Ruft!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.470
What's wrong?

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:17.130
A large monster has appeared near the city!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.590
What?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.840
The Master was there and drove 
it away with fire magic.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.500
But it headed for the forest.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.770
If it circles around the mountain, 
it will come here!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.100
It's coming, Brother Ruft.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.310
Seika?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:46.120
An elder newt?

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.370
Close all the windows!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.920
Everyone, get deeper into the mansion!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.950
Hurry!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.950
Yes, sir!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.630
You go with them, Seika!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.000
Seika!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:19.790
<i>Yifa...</i>

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.230
<i>What was that?</i>

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:32.670
<i>The hitodama protected her?</i>

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.910
<i>Hitodama don't have a will of their own.</i>

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:40.510
<i>Which means she did it herself...</i>

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.420
Good stuff.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:43.950
Hey.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.180
This way.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:57.900
Seika!

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:03.280
Phase of wood, fire, and earth.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.860
Poison Oni Flame!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.610
Taming complete.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:25.850
<i>Dalmatian chrysanthemum.</i>

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:29.690
A poison harmless to humans, 
but effective against lizards.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:33.100
Combined with fire, it used to be 
deadly when used on salamanders.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.650
Seika?

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:38.690
He defeated it with one attack?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.480
That powerful monster, 
defeated in a single attack?

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:44.100
Master Seika is incredible...

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:46.700
Master Seika defeated the elder newt!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:47.860
He's so strong!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:00.590
<i>Good. This is just how I hoped it would go.</i>

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:05.310
<i>In my next life, I'll be cunning.</i>

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:09.930
Episode 1
The Strongest Exorcist

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.930
<i>I'll be happy.</i>
